Subject: [PATCH] [SW-94540] gaudi3: validate BTL

validate functionality of BTL with the 4 commands.
create empty uboot, preboot binaries.
and remove dependency on ppboot, as we don't
want to compile the file for arm (actually it will
fail compilation anyway)

